.TH temporal-tui-profile-set-default 1  "set-default "
.SH NAME
temporal\-tui\-profile\-set\-default \- Select the default profile
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtemporal\-tui profile set\-default\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Select the default profile
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Alternate config file. Defaults to the platform user config directory
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR
Named connection profile
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
